  "description": "Based on ET board 7510452000. Component-level Return emphasis, M5207L01 gain and output path; equivalent analog full-wave peak detector and release using the original Threshold network, 4.7 uF hold and Decay range. Return_Normal represents the normalled jack contact. The plugin provides a single audio input.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
